Project licensing scope
=======================

The original application-specific code in this repository is supplied for
source publication. No additional open-source license is granted for that code
by this notice. Rights remain with the respective copyright holders. An owner
may add an explicit license for their own work in a subsequent revision.

Third-party components retain their original licenses and copyright notices.
This notice does not replace or restrict permissions granted by those licenses.
See THIRD_PARTY_NOTICES.md and LICENSES/ for component-specific information.

The CT117E LCD example and font files do not contain a separately identified
redistribution license in the supplied source materials. Their original notices
are retained; no broader rights are asserted by this repository.
